# PIT Optimizer V5 Learning/Search SDD Ledger

## Preflight interface scan

| Producer | Consumers | Boundary | Ruling |
|---|---|---|---|
| Task 1 | Tasks 2, 5–9 | Closed V5 manifest, role, evidence, and resource contracts | Must bind the complete authenticated artifact graph and four discovery episodes before identity/search/runtime code. |
| Task 2 | Tasks 3–6, 8–9 | Panel-independent policy revision identity and panel-bound experiment identity | Source identity stays stable across panels; experiment identity binds round and discovery plan. |
| Task 3 | Tasks 4–6, 8 | Deterministic template rendering and local variant expansion | One authored template may create up to manifest-capped variants without extra provider calls. |
| Task 4 | Tasks 5–6, 8 | Six-method V3 semantic fingerprint | Behavioral equivalence is a typed untestable outcome before portfolio evaluation. |
| Task 5 | Tasks 6, 8–9 | Immutable event journal, experiment records, checkpoint, bounded projection | Durable complete learning precedes any archive transition; role projection never truncates stored memory. |
| Task 6 | Tasks 8–9 | Transparent compounded campaign CAGR, archive, scheduling | Four authenticated episodes and non-zero total activity are required; no weighted score. |
| Task 7 | Tasks 8–9 | Provider-neutral authorized role runner and typed failures | Fixture and live providers share one binding parser; retries/repairs default to zero and require distinct slots. |
| Task 8 | Task 9 | Injected runtime and owned local adapters | Persist evidence as it arrives; mutate archive only after critic/final records are durable; exact owned cleanup. |
| Task 9 | Later campaign plan | Thin CLI/legacy dispatch | V5 stays out of V4 monoliths; no live run in this phase. |

## Controller rulings

1. User override: do not create, modify, or expand tests until the optimizer works end to end. Plan test-writing steps are replaced with existing focused checks, Ruff/compile, and deterministic direct smokes.
2. No provider calls, Docker evaluation, qualification, replay, push, or merge in this implementation phase.
3. Keep all V5 pure-domain modules free of CLI, provider, Git, Docker, subprocess, and filesystem implementations.
4. Preserve annualized portfolio CAGR as the transparent primary objective; do not introduce a weighted composite score.
5. Preserve V2–V4 readers and behavior. V5 is additive through narrow adapters, not appended control flow in legacy monoliths.
6. Missing local market-data artifacts block only data-dependent campaign construction/evaluation, not source architecture.

